.env
.env.local
# Written by scripts/dev-bootstrap.ps1; carries the edge encryption key.
# apps/pos/.env.dev.example documents its shape and IS tracked.
.env.dev
# Vite's own convention: `.env.[mode].local` is what a plain `pnpm dev` reads
# (mode defaults to `development`), so it is where per-machine KDS config
# actually lives. Never tracked; `.env.dev.example` documents the shape.
.env.*.local

# Personal notes, never shared with developers or committed.
priv_docs/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Untracked non-track artefacts, decided 2026-08-21 ------------------------
# None of these were created by a Holler milestone track. They were swept into a
# commit once by a `git add -A` and had to be removed, so they are ignored
# rather than left loose for that to happen again.
#
# Marketing site drafts. Note the repo already tracks several older
# website/*.html files; that inconsistency is pre-existing and not resolved
# here — these are simply not added to it.
/holler-website-v8.html
/website/holler-website-v*.html
/website/holler-site/
/imgs/og.png
